From b43be5b475a9240484587f26144ad6b878aa02c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 04:10:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Zune music: liked songs

Y on Now Playing likes the song, or unlikes it: a heart, a note for a
moment, and the song at the end of liked songs - first among the
playlists, with a heart for its cover. A like from a list's options does
the same.

The order is kept on the card as Playlists/liked songs.m3u8, an
ordinary playlist; ratings.tsv stays what says a song is liked. The menu
shows the list from memory, so a like is there at once without a rescan,
and the scanned copy of the file is not shown twice. A song put on the
file by hand counts as liked; one disliked comes off.
